SUMMARY:Classy Cocktails & Comedy
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\nReady for another dangerously charming Ash
 eville evening with excellent cocktails and questionable life choices? 
 😄\n\nJoin us for this month’s AVL Digital Nomads Classy Cocktails\, t
 his time with a rooftop comedy twist at [Antidote](https://www.antidote.ba
 r/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\, located at 12 Coxe Ave in the heart of South 
 Slope.\n\nAntidote is tucked away on the south slope of downtown Asheville
  has ambiance in spades with vintage lounge vibes\, craft cocktails\, warm
  lighting\, and just the right amount of “we accidentally stayed out way
  later than planned” energy.\n\nThe rooftop bar has become a favorite lo
 cal hangout for people who appreciate fresh air\, signature drinks\, frien
 dly locals and Comedy shows on Thursday nights!\n\nWe’ll kick things off
  with our traditional Classy Cocktails happy hour from 6:00–8:00 PM\, wh
 ere you can connect with fellow digital nomads\, entrepreneurs\, creatives
 \, and remote workers\, from around Asheville and beyond.\n\nFor those of 
 you who want to keep the night rolling\, we’ll stay for the comedy show 
 from 8:30–10:00 PM.\n\nComedy cover charge is approximately $10–15.\nY
 ou are welcome to join us for just cocktails\, just comedy\, or the full c
 lassy-cocktail comedic adventure.\n\n**What to expect:**\n• Rooftop cock
 tails in a relaxed upscale atmosphere\n• Great conversations and new con
 nections\n• Asheville locals and travelers mingling together\n• A fun 
 night out with friends\n• Laughing at comedians and possibly yourself\n\
 n**Event Details**\n📍 Antidote\n12 Coxe Ave\, Asheville\, NC 28801\n
 🕕 Classy Cocktails Happy Hour: 6:00–8:00 PM\n🎤 Comedy Show: 8:30
 –10:00 PM\n🎟️ Comedy Cover: $10–15\n🍸 Rooftop Bar Vibes
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/avl-digital-nomads/events/315283171/
