SUMMARY:AVL Digital Nomads - Book Club
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\n**November 2026 Selection - *Klara and the
  Sun* by Kazuo Ishiguro**\n[Amazon](https://www.amazon.com/dp/059331817X) 
 - [GoodReads](https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/54120408-klara-and-the-s
 un)\n\n*Here is the story of Klara\, an Artificial Friend with outstanding
  observational qualities\, who\, from her place in the store\, watches car
 efully the behavior of those who come in to browse\, and of those who pass
  on the street outside. She remains hopeful that a customer will soon choo
 se her. Klara and the Sun is a thrilling book that offers a look at our ch
 anging world through the eyes of an unforgettable narrator\, and one that 
 explores the fundamental question: what does it mean to love?*\n\n\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\n\n**Welcome to our monthly Book Club!** We’re a small\, friendly g
 roup that gets together for fun\, thoughtful conversations about a differe
 nt book each month.\n\nFinished the whole book? Great. Only made it throug
 h a few chapters? Still come. Didn’t read it at all but the discussion s
 ounds interesting? Honestly\, you’re welcome too.\nWe meet on the **firs
 t Tuesday of every month**.\n\nOne of the best things about this group is 
 that we keep it relatively small and guide the conversation\, so it doesn
 ’t turn into three people talking while everyone else quietly questions 
 their life choices. Everyone has a chance to jump in\, share their thought
 s\, and explore the book’s characters\, themes\, writing\, and bigger id
 eas.\n\nYou definitely don’t need to be a literary expert. Whether you r
 ead constantly or you’re trying to get back into it\, this is a relaxed 
 place to discover new books\, hear different perspectives\, and meet some 
 great people along the way.
